==================================================================1500 1451   10
The Livermore Evaluated Atomic Data Library (EADL) in the         1500 1451   11
ENDF-6 Format. Translated from the Livermore ENDL format          1500 1451   12
to the ENDF-6 Format by Bob MacFarlane (Los Alamos).              1500 1451   13
==================================================================1500 1451   14
  Contents                                                        1500 1451   15
==================================================================1500 1451   16
  MF/MT    Description                                            1500 1451   17
